    <body>
      <p source="#source-24-62"><seg source="#source-24-62">落ちしのばらの芽はひかり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-62-99"><seg source="#source-62-99">樹液はしづにかはたれぬ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-99-131"><seg source="#source-99-131">あゝこの夕つゝましく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-131-168"><seg source="#source-131-168">きみと祈らばよからんを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-168-206"><seg source="#source-168-206">きみきたらずばわが成さん</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-206-243"><seg source="#source-206-243">この園つひにむなしけん</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-243-275"><seg source="#source-243-275">西天黄ばみにごれるに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-275-305"><seg source="#source-275-305">雲の黒闇の見もあへず</seg></p>
    </body>
